'''Roona''' was a [[Vazooan]] [[Gender|female]] [[Homeworld|native]] of the [[planet]] [[At Attin]] who attended [[At Attin Middle School Gamma]]. The [[Local day|day]] before her [[Career Assessment Test]] around [[9 ABY]], [[Undersecretary]] [[Fara]] from the [[Office of the Supervisor]] visited one of Roona's lessons and, at the [[Unidentified droid teacher|droid teacher's]] prompting, Roona informed the undersecretary that she wished to become a [[senior statistical accountant]]. Roona's classmate [[Neel]] had a crush on her despite the two never having spoken.

==Biography==
{{Quote|I don't want to get held back, Wim. I wouldn't be in the same class as Roona anymore.''"<br />"''As Roona?''"<br />"''I like her.''"<br />"''But you've never even talked to her.''"<br />"''I'm working up to it.|Neel and Wim|audio=Neel-Wim-Roona-SC1.flac|<ref name="SC1" />}}
[[File:RoonaFernKB-SC1.png|thumb|right|300px|Roona attended At Attin Middle School Gamma.]]
Roona was a [[Vazooan]] [[Gender|female]]<ref name="DB" /> student of [[At Attin Middle School Gamma]] on<ref name="SC1" /> her [[homeworld]], [[At Attin]],<ref name="DB" /> a [[planet]] separated from the rest of [[the galaxy]] by the [[Barrier]].<ref name="SC1" /> Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref> the [[Local day|day]] before she and her classmates were due to take the [[Career Assessment Test]]&mdash;which would decide their roles within At Attin's [[Great Work]]&mdash;Roona arrived at school alongside the other students and on her way into the building passed the students [[Fern]] and [[KB]] being lectured by<ref name="SC1" /> a [[safety droid]]<ref name="SC1AD">{{SkeletonCrew|This Could Be a Real Adventure}} {{AD|Disney+}}</ref> for flying a [[Speeder bike|hoverbike]] into school.<ref name="SC1" />

Roona then attended a lesson led by a [[Unidentified droid teacher|droid teacher]] who, part-way through the lesson, introduced the class to [[Undersecretary]] [[Fara]], a special visitor from the [[Office of the Supervisor]]. Roona and the other students greeted Fara, who then spoke to them about the importance of the Career Assessment Test. When the teacher asked the students to state how they would like to contribute to the Great Work, Roona keenly raised her hand and was selected to answer first, stating that she wished to become a [[senior statistical accountant]]. After Roona answered, her classmate [[Neel]]<ref name="SC1" /> gazed at her longingly<ref name="SC1AD" /> from the row behind. He had a crush on her, but had never spoken to her before and was working up to saying something.<ref name="SC1" />

[[File:RoonaClassroom-SC1.png|thumb|left|300px|Undersecretary Fara visited Roona's class.]]
Neel confided in his friend [[Wim]] about his crush when the pair later discussed the upcoming assessment, fearing that if he was held back then he would no longer be in Roona's class. When Fern and KB later tricked Neel and Wim into thinking they were being questioned by a safety [[droid]], KB ordered the pair to reveal who they had a crush on at school and Neel cried out Roona's name.<ref name="SC1" />

==Personality and traits==
Roona had [[Color|green]] and white [[Hair|fur]], black [[eye]]s, and pink skin.<ref name="SC1" /> She was a good student<ref name="Topps">{{Topps|set=2025 Topps Chrome Star Wars|cardname=#157 - Roona|link=https://www.ebay.com/itm/336181878109}}</ref> and dreamed of becoming a senior statistical accountant on At Attin<ref name="DB" /> to help with the Great Work.<ref name="Topps" />

==Equipment==
While at school, Roona wore a [[Clothing|uniform]] including a tan [[School jacket|jacket]], gray pants, black shoes, and a turquoise shirt.<ref name="SC1" />

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:PhoenixNotary-LegacyFX.png|thumb|right|200px|Phoenix Notary portrayed Roona.]]
Roona appeared in "[[This Could Be a Real Adventure]],"<ref name="SC1" /> the first episode of the [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which aired on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Early">{{SW|url=news/skeleton-crew-premiere-date|text=''Star Wars: Skeleton Crew'' Will Debut Early|date=2024-11-26}}</ref> The episode's credits lists performance artist [[Phoenix Notary]] and [[Iliana Castillo]] as portraying the character<ref name="SC1" /> and [[Shelby Young]] has stated she voiced Roona.<ref name="Shelby">{{Twitter|username=shelby_young|url=status/1864011881112809788|name=[[Shelby Young]]|date=2024-12-03|quote=SKELETON CREW IS OUT! You can hear me as cute lil Roona in the fist episode and providing other additional voices throughout the show. SO thrilled to be part of this project, it's really, really special 💚 #voiceover #starwars|archivedate=2024-12-04|archiveurl=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/qFMkt|archivefile=File:ShelbyYoung-Roona-Twitter.png}}</ref>

The character's costume was created by [[Legacy Effects]] and included multiple heads and a harness with sleeves for the arms.<ref name="Legacy">{{WebCite|url=https://www.legacyefx.com/skeleton-crew|text=Skeleton Crew|work=[[Legacy Effects]]|archivedate=20250226013146}}</ref> Prior to the release of the episode, the character was first pictured in the show's first trailer, which was released on [[August 10]], 2024.<ref name="Trailer">{{SWYouTube|a6voXgBlmpk|Skeleton Crew &#124; Official Trailer &#124; Streaming December 3 on Disney+|date=August 10, 2024}}</ref>

